/**
 * Mock Discord profile badges.
 *
 * The SVGs are local visual replicas, shown only by this client. They do not
 * grant badges, achievements or any other entitlement.
 *
 * Artwork and badge names come from https://github.com/dev-hoehle/discord-badges
 * (see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md). Some of these badges are Discord betas or
 * event-only collectibles; they are listed here purely for local display.
 *
 * Add a badge by appending an entry below; the settings picker and profile
 * renderer pick it up automatically.
 */

